/*@meta

Author:
'Sound Dust'

Description:
'A dog that does magic tricks\r\nHold notes and wait'

Usage:
'MW magic wand\r\nAT rabbit in hat'

Categories:
'Pads:Atonal, Pads:Drones, Pads:Evolving, Pads:Soundscape, FX:Noise & Rumble'

